# Design System Rules

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css` and are exposed via Tailwind in `src/styles/globals.css`:
- Backgrounds: `--bg #F3F5F7`, `--surface #FFFFFF`, `--subtle #E9EEF2`
- Borders: `--line #DDE3E8`, `--line-strong #C8D0D8`
- Text: `--ink #0F172A`, `--ink-muted #64748B`, `--ink-faint #94A3B8`
- Brand: `--primary #0B558B`, `--primary-hover #084572`, `--accent #9A7B4F` (brass)
- Status: `--available #1F7A4D`, `--sold #9B2C2C`
- Radius: `8px` controls/buttons, `12px` cards, `16px` dialogs/modal sheets
- Elevation: `--shadow-card: 0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06)`; floating layer `--shadow-floating` for dialogs/toasts/popovers. Soft card elevation is allowed via the `.card` utility.

## Typography & Numbers
- **Geist (sans)**: UI, headings, buttons, KPIs, money, prices, areas, and chart axes.
- **Numbers**: Always use `tabular-nums` (`font-sans tabular-nums`), right-aligned in tables and cards. Currency formatted via `formatPkr` / `formatPkrCompact` / `formatPkrLedger`.
- **Geist Mono (`.unit-code`, `.font-mono`)**: ONLY for unit codes, booking references, IDs, and cryptographic hashes. Never use Mono for prices, areas, KPI totals, or chart labels.

## Components & Cards
- Cards: `.card` utility (surface background, 1px line border, 12px border radius, `--shadow-card` elevation). Interactive cards lift slightly on hover (`translateY(-1px)`).
- Buttons: Primary solid `#0B558B` (hover `#084572`, `h-9`, `rounded-[8px]`); secondary white with `line-strong` border; retain `active:scale-[0.98]`.
- Navigation: Sidebar active item displays a subtle brass left bar (`--accent`).

## Motion & Transitions
- Micro-interactions timed between 120ms and 240ms with `cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1)`.
- Transitions-dev required patterns:
  - Number pop-in / count-up for KPI cards on view and filter changes.
  - Panel reveal for sheets and drawers.
  - Modal open / close for dialogs.
  - Page enter transitions (180ms).
  - Status badge swap animation.
  - Success check stroke-draw for completed actions (sell / reverse / save).
- Always respect `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.

## Bans
- No Lucide icons (use Phosphor light icons only).
- No purple, rainbow, or loud gradient backgrounds.
- No Recharts (use visx).
- No raw default shadcn components.
